  "contentHtml": "<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center;background:white;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;\"><br>\r\n</span> \r\n</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center;background:white;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;\">关于领取<span>2025</span>年度清华大学先进集体</span><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;\">、</span><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;\">先进工作者</span> \r\n</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center;background:white;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;\">工会系统先进集体和个人表彰证书的通知</span><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:#454545;\"></span> \r\n</p>\r\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"text-align:right;text-indent:28.2pt;background:white;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文仿宋;color:black;\">                                      </span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文仿宋;color:black;\">清工发〔<span>2026</span>〕<span>32</span>号</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文仿宋;color:#454545;\"></span> \r\n</p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;background:white;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文仿宋;color:black;\">各分工会：</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文仿宋;color:#454545;\"></span> \r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"background:white;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文仿宋;color:black;\">        </span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文仿宋;color:black;\">兹定于<span>9</span>月<span>8</span>日在工会俱乐部（荷花池东）发放<span>2025</span>年度清华大学先进集体、先进工作者、工会系统先进集体及个人的表彰证书。为避免人员过于聚集，建议各单位按以下安排时段前往。</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文仿宋;color:#454545;\"></span> \r\n</p>\r\n<div align=\"center\">\r\n\t<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"755\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;border:none;\">\r\n\t\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t\t<td width=\"56\" style=\"border:solid window