\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;text-indent:28.2pt;background:white;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文仿宋;color:black;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文仿宋;color:#454545;\"></span> \r\n</p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;background:white;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文仿宋;color:black;\">        附件：各奖励名单</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文仿宋;color:#454545;\"></span> \r\n</p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;text-indent:28.2pt;background:white;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文仿宋;color:black;\"><a href=\"http://ghxt.cic.tsinghua.edu.cn/kindeditor/upload/file/20260902/20260902184555_868.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#337FE5;\">附件1. 2025年度清华大学先进集体先进工作者表彰名单</span></a><span></span></span> \r\n</p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;text-indent:28.2pt;background:white;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文仿宋;color:black;\"><a href=\"http://ghxt.cic.tsinghua.edu.cn/kindeditor/upload/file/20260902/20260902184614_490.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#337FE5;\">附件2. 2025年度清华大学优秀、先进分工会表彰名单</span></a><span></span></span> \r\n</p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;text-indent:28.2pt;background:white;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文仿宋;color:black;\"><a href=\"http://ghxt.cic.tsinghua.edu.cn/kindeditor/upload/file/20260902/20260902184627_76.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#337FE5;\">附件3. 2025年度清华大学工会积极分子表彰名单</span></a><span> </span></span> \r\n</p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;text-indent:28.2pt;background:white;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;font-family:华文仿宋;color:black;\"><a href=\"http://ghxt.cic.tsinghua.edu.cn/kindeditor/upload/file/20260902/20260902184642_636.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#337FE5;\">附件4. 2025年度清华大学分工会“一会一品”品牌工作案例表彰名单</span></a><span></span></span> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"tex